</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Sheaves after sowing,</l><l>Sun after rain,</l><l>Sight after mystery,</l><l>Peace after pain;</l><l>Joy after sorrow,</l><l>Calm after blast,</l><l>Rest after weariness,</l><l>Sweet rest at last.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Near after distant,</l><l>Gleam after gloom,</l><l>Love after loneliness,</l><l>Life after tomb;</l><l>After long agony,</l><l>Rapture of bliss,</l><l>Right was the pathway,</l><l>Leading to this.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
